.th DZ IV 18/8/77
.sh NAME
dz \*- DZ-11 8 line asynchronous communications multiplexor
.sh DESCRIPTION
Each line attached to the DZ-11 behaves as
described in
.it tty
(IV).
Each line is fully programmable
for speed, parity, byte size, and modem control.
See
.it stty
(II) for the encoding.
.sh FILES
/dev/tty[i-p]
.sh "SEE ALSO"
.it tty
(IV),
.it stty
(II), 
.it stty
(I)
.sh AUTHOR
Piers Lauder (\ University of Sydney\ )
.sh BUGS
